<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "description" .
