<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/description> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a human-readable description of an entity" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/description> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> .
