<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/start_coordinate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The position at which the subject genomic entity starts on the chromosome or other entity to which it is located on. (ie: the start of the sequence being referenced is 1)." .
