<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_1000032> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indel" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_1000032> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "loinc:LA9659-9" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_1000032> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "deletion-insertion" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_1000032> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "indel" .
