_:genid120 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Publication> .
_:genid120 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/mentioned_by> .
