# https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/linkml/ClassDefinition#Mixin> .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In MVIKG: instances are minted per-record (scoped to document + organism + gene symbol), not shared across papers/organisms, to avoid collisions when the same gene symbol denotes different genes in different organisms. The canonical resolved gene identity is reachable one hop away via dcterms:identifier. The same per-record blank-node pattern applies to biolink:SequenceVariant and biolink:PhenotypicFeature instances." .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "genomic entity" .
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/GenomicEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .
