<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/Publication> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Any ‘published’ piece of information. Publications are considered broadly to include any document or document part made available in print or on the web - which may include scientific journal issues, individual articles, and books - as well as things like pre-prints, white papers, patents, drug labels, web pages, protocol documents,  and even a part of a publication if of significant knowledge scope (e.g. a figure, figure legend, or section highlighted by NLP)." .
